Z||000000||Ozzy||04-17-2000||02:01 AM||||Hey Gang.<P>So I got my cooling system ironed out finally. I forget who posted a statement about a trace being burnt on the control head...(think it was Phil) but that was it. It was stopping my coolant fan coming on while the Air cond. was turned on. I'm curious why it burnt out that way though.<BR>The numbskull that had the car before me hot wired the fan by just splicing into any old 12v + wire he could find and splicing onto the fan wire with it still connected to it's original source. This may have created a back feed of some kind but I don't know.<P>Anyhow, it's peachy now! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ozzy||||reg||10
